OL,3,GNEWSADeath of boy hit by bus an
OL,4,Aaccident, inquest finds
OL,5,
OL,6,FA bus driver heard "a young voice
OL,7,Fscreaming 'stop'" as the vehicle pulled
OL,8,Faway from a pedestrian crossing and
OL,9,Fcollided with a four-year-old boy at a
OL,10,FKent hospital, an inquest has heard.
OL,12,FZaahir Jan died when he was struck
OL,13,Foutside the Queen Elizabeth The Queen
OL,14,FMother Hospital in Margate on 7 August,
OL,15,F2025.
OL,17,FThe bus driver said in a witness
OL,18,Fstatement that, after hearing the
OL,19,Fscreaming she "felt a bump with the
OL,20,Fbus" and believed she had "run
OL,21,Fsomething over" and applied the
OL,22,Fhandbrake.
