OL,4,Aaccident, inquest finds
OL,5,
OL,6,FDeclaring the death an accident, area
OL,7,Fcoroner for Kent and Medway, Sarah
OL,8,FClarke, found no evidence the driver
OL,9,Fhad been impaired, distracted or could
OL,10,Fhave avoided the collision.
